rofiles><profile id="ce73-2651-f4d1-740f" name="Gaunt Summoner" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">5&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">5+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">2</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="80a-b87-549e-bb08" name="Leaden Limbs" hidden="false" typeId="7312-8367-c171-f2ef" typeName="Ability (Spell)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="de6f-d57b-248a-83be">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Casting Value" typeId="9fc7-b0f6-d018-a608">7</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">Pick a visible enemy unit within 18&quot; of this unit to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">Until the start of your next turn:
• Halve the target's Move characteristic.
• The effects of the 'Fly' ability do not apply to the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="353f-565e-c351-1cf2"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="16b6-0911-f549-a4bd">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="da27-8d61-f955-5031">Movement</attribute></attributes></profile><profile id="52ed-0540-9465-91c0" name="Masters of the Silver Towers" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">Enemy units cannot end a charge move within 1/2&quot; of a friendly **Argent Shard** that is wholly within 12&quot; of this unit and was set up on the battlefield in the same turn.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Orange</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Movement</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="156c-f17a-1a1d-eaea" name="All Belongs to Tzeentch" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Battle (Army), Start of Any Turn</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick an objective you do not control and that you controlled earlier in the battle to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">You control the target objective.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Control</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="3bc-444a-5cf8-e4d" name="Guarded Hero" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If this **^^Hero^^** is within the combat range of a friendly unit that is not a **^^Hero^^**:
• Subtract 1 from hit rolls for shooting attacks that target this Hero.
• If this **^^Hero^^** is **^^Infantry^^**, they cannot be picked as the target of shooting attacks made by models more than 12&quot; from them.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="ro53gz9" name="Gaunt Summoner" entryId="76e8-52c1-d788-32d4::aab-58ed-53d3-8457" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="rucil29" name="Changestaff" entryId="76e8-52c1-d788-32d4::b0f8-9d52-3904-15c3" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="d5c5-9c43-ea73-f75f" name="Changestaff" hidden="false" typeId="1fd-a42f-41d3-fe05" typeName="Ranged Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Rng" typeId="c6b5-908c-a604-1a98">12&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="aa17-4296-2887-e05d">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="194d-aeb6-5ba7-83b4">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="d3d5-9dc6-13de-8d1">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="d03f-a9ae-3eec-755">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="96c2-d0a5-ea1e-653b">D3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="d793-3dd7-9c13-741e">Crit (Mortal)</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="ruczbpk" name="Warptongue Blade" entryId="76e8-52c1-d788-32d4::cd0-e303-1e12-a5f4" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="4e40-4e56-e7fe-ecfd" name="Warptongue Blade" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="180" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" name="CHAOS" entryId="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" primary="false" /><category id="dc0b-e417-51f4-10f0" name="DAEMON" entryId="dc0b-e417-51f4-10f0" primary="false" /><category id="d64d-ec64-3cf-cc4" name="DISCIPLES OF TZEENTCH" entryId="d64d-ec64-3cf-cc4" primary="false" /><category id="8179-697a-9f4c-91d4" name="WIZARD (2)" entryId="8179-697a-9f4c-91d4" primary="false" /><category id="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" name="INFANTRY" entryId="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" primary="false" /><category id="52cc-95fd-6cd3-8f72" name="WARD (5+)" entryId="52cc-95fd-6cd3-8f72" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="s43pc2f" name="Gaunt Summoner on Disc of Tzeentch" entryId="572b-75e3-a607-a08e::2be4-1886-121b-9f10" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="a9e7-fe9a-1e82-4c70" name="Gaunt Summoner on Disc of Tzeentch" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">14&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">7</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">5+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">2</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="65d7-7943-73eb-eff1" name="Masters of the Silver Towers" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">Enemy units cannot end a charge move within 1/2&quot; of a friendly **Argent Shard** that is wholly within 12&quot; of this unit and was set up on the battlefield in the same turn.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Orange</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Movement</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="bfd6-8c94-ffde-524c" name="Arcane Imprisonment" hidden="false" typeId="7312-8367-c171-f2ef" typeName="Ability (Spell)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="de6f-d57b-248a-83be">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Casting Value" typeId="9fc7-b0f6-d018-a608">7</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">Pick an enemy **^^Hero^^** in combat with this unit to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">If the unmodified casting roll exceeds the target's Health characteristic, it is automatically destroyed and cannot be replaced for the rest of the battle.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="353f-565e-c351-1cf2">**^^Spell^^**</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="16b6-0911-f549-a4bd">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="da27-8d61-f955-5031">Offensive</attribute></attributes></profile><profile id="94eb-13e1-e74-a9b6" name="All Belongs to Tzeentch" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Battle (Army), Start of Any Turn</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick an objective you do not control and that you controlled earlier in the battle to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">You control the target objective.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Control</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="3bc-444a-5cf8-e4d" name="Guarded Hero" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If this **^^Hero^^** is within the combat range of a friendly unit that is not a **^^Hero^^**:
• Subtract 1 from hit rolls for shooting attacks that target this Hero.
• If this **^^Hero^^** is **^^Infantry^^**, they cannot be picked as the target of shooting attacks made by models more than 12&quot; from them.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="8e01-c601-8a44-8f74" name="Fly" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">As this unit moves, it ignores other models, terrain features and the combat ranges of enemy units. It cannot end its move in combat unless specified in the ability that allowed it to move. Ignore any vertical distance moved for this unit.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Gray</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Movement</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="s42ta0b" name="Gaunt Summoner on Disc of Tzeentch" entryId="572b-75e3-a607-a08e::fffa-f326-667d-bbac" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="sacaspa" name="Changestaff" entryId="572b-75e3-a607-a08e::2477-f845-ba27-d39b" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="41b0-ef03-8508-6877" name="Changestaff" hidden="false" typeId="1fd-a42f-41d3-fe05" typeName="Ranged Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Rng" typeId="c6b5-908c-a604-1a98">12&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="aa17-4296-2887-e05d">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="194d-aeb6-5ba7-83b4">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="d3d5-9dc6-13de-8d1">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="d03f-a9ae-3eec-755">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="96c2-d0a5-ea1e-653b">D3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="d793-3dd7-9c13-741e">Crit (Mortal)</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="saekn2" name="Disc's Teeth and Horns" entryId="572b-75e3-a607-a08e::f6e8-a37b-2aee-1069" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="99a-8be2-bfc6-6ea" name="Disc's Teeth and Horns" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">D3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Companion</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="satmk9" name="Warptongue Blade" entryId="572b-75e3-a607-a08e::a3d1-b074-c9ad-956" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="d320-6e8b-59a9-cd05" name="Warptongue Blade" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="210" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" name="CHAOS" entryId="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" primary="false" /><category id="dc0b-e417-51f4-10f0" name="DAEMON" entryId="dc0b-e417-51f4-10f0" primary="false" /><category id="d64d-ec64-3cf-cc4" name="DISCIPLES OF TZEENTCH" entryId="d64d-ec64-3cf-cc4" primary="false" /><category id="8179-697a-9f4c-91d4" name="WIZARD (2)" entryId="8179-697a-9f4c-91d4" primary="false" /><category id="926c-df8c-6841-d49e" name="CAVALRY" entryId="926c-df8c-6841-d49e" primary="false" /><category id="6960-3f0d-5b0-2ec4" name="DISC OF TZEENTCH" entryId="6960-3f0d-5b0-2ec4" primary="false" /><category id="b979-4c3e-7d0e-6921" name="FLY" entryId="b979-4c3e-7d0e-6921" primary="false" /><category id="52cc-95fd-6cd3-8f72" name="WARD (5+)" entryId="52cc-95fd-6cd3-8f72" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="sk29jc" name="Kairos Fateweaver" entryId="56f-db5c-971b-4bc0::4c5d-ac6e-7aa5-6d98" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="bb64-e4a2-79c-243c" name="Battle Damaged" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">While this unit has 10 or more damage points, subtract 1 from its power level.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Damage</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="a036-81dd-c092-46ba" name="Kairos Fateweaver" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">12&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">16</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">5+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">5</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="632c-3ca6-184a-3150" name="Master of Destiny" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If this unit has not already **engineered the outcome** this battle round, instead of making a casting roll, unbinding roll, banishment roll, hit roll, wound roll, or save roll for a visible friendly **^^Disciples of Tzeentch^^** unit wholly within 12&quot; of this unit, this unit can **engineer the outcome**.
If the roll would have been a D6 roll, you can use a value of 6 for the roll, you can use a value of 6 for it that cannot be modified. If the roll would have been a 2D6 roll, you can use a value of 9 for it that cannot be modified.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="3190-ba6f-d691-6ee7" name="Mastery of Magic" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">When you make a casting roll for this unit, you can change the lowest D6 to match the highest D6.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="4ea0-d922-2fce-abab" name="Fateful Reverse" hidden="false" typeId="7312-8367-c171-f2ef" typeName="Ability (Spell)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="de6f-d57b-248a-83be">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Casting Value" typeId="9fc7-b0f6-d018-a608">8</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">Pick a visible enemy unit within 18&quot; of this unit to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">Until the start of your next turn:
• If the target charged in the same turn, friendly **^^Disciples of Tzeentch^^** units in combat with the target have **^^Strike-first^^**.
• The target's weapons cannot be affected by the **Charge (+1 Damage)** weapon ability.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="353f-565e-c351-1cf2">**^^Spell^^**</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="16b6-0911-f549-a4bd">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="da27-8d61-f955-5031">Special</attribute></attributes></profile><profile id="fd9f-effb-821e-ae2c" name="Beacon of Sorcery" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">Add 1 to casting rolls and unbinding rolls for friendly **^^Disciples of Tzeentch Wizards^^** while they are wholly within 12&quot; of this unit.
In addition, if a friendly **^^Disciples of Tzeentch Wizard^^** wholly within 12&quot; of this unit unbinds a spell, no command points are spent for that **^^Wizard^^** to use the 'Magical Intervention' command in that phase.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="8e01-c601-8a44-8f74" name="Fly" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">As this unit moves, it ignores other models, terrain features and the combat ranges of enemy units. It cannot end its move in combat unless specified in the ability that allowed it to move. Ignore any vertical distance moved for this unit.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Gray</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Movement</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="slyt8x6" name="Kairos Fateweaver" entryId="56f-db5c-971b-4bc0::abf-32ec-4a01-f5ea" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="sntkpvp" name="Curved Beaks" entryId="56f-db5c-971b-4bc0::b3a0-2a26-b953-dd3c" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="2820-7cba-1ce6-653b" name="Curved Beaks" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="sn0f1pg" name="Staff of Tomorrow" entryId="56f-db5c-971b-4bc0::6547-5c5-d8dc-fe97" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="80c-452f-393b-85e5" name="Staff of Tomorrow" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">4</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">2+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">D3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="400" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="72ce-2188-70bf-2dbd" name="UNIQUE" entryId="72ce-2188-70bf-2dbd" primary="false" /><category id="c203-51a0-3d44-6b07" name="WARMASTER" entryId="c203-51a0-3d44-6b07" primary="false" /><category id="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" name="CHAOS" entryId="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" primary="false" /><category id="dc0b-e417-51f4-10f0" name="DAEMON" entryId="dc0b-e417-51f4-10f0" primary="false" /><category id="6d54-625c-d063-13e2" name="MONSTER" entryId="6d54-625c-d063-13e2" primary="false" /><category id="52cc-95fd-6cd3-8f72" name="WARD (5+)" entryId="52cc-95fd-6cd3-8f72" primary="false" /><category id="8bc-6d63-e37f-9239" name="WIZARD (3)" entryId="8bc-6d63-e37f-9239" primary="false" /><category id="b979-4c3e-7d0e-6921" name="FLY" entryId="b979-4c3e-7d0e-6921" primary="false" /><category id="d64d-ec64-3cf-cc4" name="DISCIPLES OF TZEENTCH" entryId="d64d-ec64-3cf-cc4" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="t015m9l" name="Lord of Change" entryId="1f47-6195-e2f1-45dc::6dc0-c258-8f57-d9ac" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="b434-af4d-9572-8e93" name="Battle Damaged" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">While this unit has 10 or more damage points, subtract 1 from its power level.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Damage</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="9800-7b11-1cab-4f7f" name="Lord of Change" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">12&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">14</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">5+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">5</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="54ed-e5a1-df72-8177" name="Summon Daemons of Tzeentch" hidden="false" typeId="55ac-f837-dded-5872" typeName="Ability (Command)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="736-6e3a-d0b5-a1b0">Once Per Turn (Army), Your Movement Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Cost" typeId="a49e-3082-e2a6-e802">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="b77f-7548-840e-c086">Pick a friendly non-**^^Hero^^** non-**^^Unique Disciples of Tzeentch Daemon^^** unit that has been destroyed to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="2111-3ca8-61dd-a5f0">Set up a replacement unit with half the number of models from the target unit (rounding up) wholly within 9&quot; of this unit and more than 9&quot; from all enemy units.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="445d-f443-5448-e7ce"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5c69-e4b9-19bc-e801">Gray</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="2bd5-08f1-f3d1-86f7">Rallying</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="df75-e7dc-12b5-48a8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="2591-cb94-c62f-6a73" name="Temporal Manipulation" hidden="false" typeId="7312-8367-c171-f2ef" typeName="Ability (Spell)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="de6f-d57b-248a-83be">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Casting Value" typeId="9fc7-b0f6-d018-a608">6</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">Pick another visible friendly **^^Disciples of Tzeentch^^** unit that was not set up this turn and that is wholly within 18&quot; of this unit to be the target. Them, make a casting roll of 2D6.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">The target can use the 'Normal Move' ability as if it were your movement phase, but it must end that move closer to this unit.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="353f-565e-c351-1cf2">**^^Spell^^**, **^^Wyrdflame^^**</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="16b6-0911-f549-a4bd">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="da27-8d61-f955-5031" /></attributes></profile><profile id="767a-ee51-b8df-8906" name="Locus of Impossibility" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">Add 1 to casting rolls for this unit. In addition, subtract 1 from hit rolls for attacks that target friendly **^^Disciples of Tzeentch Daemon^^** units while they are wholly within 12&quot; of this unit.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="8e01-c601-8a44-8f74" name="Fly" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">As this unit moves, it ignores other models, terrain features and the combat ranges of enemy units. It cannot end its move in combat unless specified in the ability that allowed it to move. Ignore any vertical distance moved for this unit.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Gray</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Movement</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="t1cmh0i" name="Lord of Change" entryId="1f47-6195-e2f1-45dc::cfd0-85b0-e577-f30f" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="t643pa" name="Eldritch Weapons" entryId="1f47-6195-e2f1-45dc::ff55-3501-bb98-c05" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="1882-9463-c32f-ac8b" name="Eldritch Weapons" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">6</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="t5a3osb" name="Storm of Wyrdfire" entryId="1f47-6195-e2f1-45dc::7ce1-109b-b93f-35d0" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="c588-3e87-aac5-f1fa" name="Storm of Wyrdfire" hidden="false" typeId="1fd-a42f-41d3-fe05" typeName="Ranged Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Rng" typeId="c6b5-908c-a604-1a98">18&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="aa17-4296-2887-e05d">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="194d-aeb6-5ba7-83b4">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="d3d5-9dc6-13de-8d1">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="d03f-a9ae-3eec-755">-</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="96c2-d0a5-ea1e-653b">D3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="d793-3dd7-9c13-741e">Crit (Auto-wound)</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="380" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" name="CHAOS" entryId="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" primary="false" /><category id="dc0b-e417-51f4-10f0" name="DAEMON" entryId="dc0b-e417-51f4-10f0" primary="false" /><category id="6d54-625c-d063-13e2" name="MONSTER" entryId="6d54-625c-d063-13e2" primary="false" /><category id="52cc-95fd-6cd3-8f72" name="WARD (5+)" entryId="52cc-95fd-6cd3-8f72" primary="false" /><category id="b979-4c3e-7d0e-6921" name="FLY" entryId="b979-4c3e-7d0e-6921" primary="false" /><category id="d64d-ec64-3cf-cc4" name="DISCIPLES OF TZEENTCH" entryId="d64d-ec64-3cf-cc4" primary="false" /><category id="8bc-6d63-e37f-9239" name="WIZARD (3)" entryId="8bc-6d63-e37f-9239" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="thj8a3" name="Magister" entryId="e43d-4771-2354-3229::5f48-17e7-d89f-183b" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="4e60-4e94-f716-adf5" name="Magister" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">5&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">6</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">2</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="3e6f-da68-d94c-4f51" name="Imbued with Arcane Fire" hidden="false" typeId="55ac-f837-dded-5872" typeName="Ability (Command)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="736-6e3a-d0b5-a1b0">Once Per Turn (Army), Any Combat Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Cost" typeId="a49e-3082-e2a6-e802">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="b77f-7548-840e-c086">Pick a visible friendly **^^Arcanite^^** unit wholly within 12&quot; of this unit to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="2111-3ca8-61dd-a5f0">The target's melee weapons have **Crit (Mortal)** until the start of your next turn.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="445d-f443-5448-e7ce"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5c69-e4b9-19bc-e801">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="2bd5-08f1-f3d1-86f7">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="df75-e7dc-12b5-48a8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="1a76-ffdf-fbdf-53e4" name="Spellmaster" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Reaction: You declared a **^^Spell^^** ability for a **^^Wizard^^** within 30&quot; of this unit and the casting roll equalled or exceeded the spell's casting value and that spell has not been unbound</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Make an unbinding roll of 2D6. If the roll exceeds the casting roll for the spell, the spell is unbound and its effect is not resolved.
If the spell is unbound, add 1 to casting rolls for this unit for the rest of the phase.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f">**^^Unbind^^**</characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="3bc-444a-5cf8-e4d" name="Guarded Hero" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If this **^^Hero^^** is within the combat range of a friendly unit that is not a **^^Hero^^**:
• Subtract 1 from hit rolls for shooting attacks that target this Hero.
• If this **^^Hero^^** is **^^Infantry^^**, they cannot be picked as the target of shooting attacks made by models more than 12&quot; from them.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="ti1v02" name="Magister" entryId="e43d-4771-2354-3229::b9eb-55ad-14b-317a" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="tq4dmh" name="Tzeentchian Runestaff" entryId="e43d-4771-2354-3229::325a-b0c6-347e-d8a5" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="e156-5262-aabd-1a2d" name="Tzeentchian Runestaff" hidden="false" typeId="1fd-a42f-41d3-fe05" typeName="Ranged Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Rng" typeId="c6b5-908c-a604-1a98">18&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="aa17-4296-2887-e05d">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="194d-aeb6-5ba7-83b4">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="d3d5-9dc6-13de-8d1">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="d03f-a9ae-3eec-755">-</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="96c2-d0a5-ea1e-653b">D3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="d793-3dd7-9c13-741e">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="tqn97im" name="Warpsteel Sword" entryId="e43d-4771-2354-3229::c358-a979-439f-89dc" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="3e8c-a4a7-1c22-18dc" name="Warpsteel Sword" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">-</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="140" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" name="CHAOS" entryId="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" primary="false" /><category id="d64d-ec64-3cf-cc4" name="DISCIPLES OF TZEENTCH" entryId="d64d-ec64-3cf-cc4" primary="false" /><category id="6f28-c3f6-4b1b-8aff" name="WIZARD (1)" entryId="6f28-c3f6-4b1b-8aff" primary="false" /><category id="4fa7-56fe-431f-fd98" name="ARCANITE" entryId="4fa7-56fe-431f-fd98" primary="false" /><category id="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" name="INFANTRY" entryId="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="tzvkgeq" name="Magister on Disc of Tzeentch" entryId="1a2d-6f5c-e17e-d2f6::378a-e2c0-6476-f128" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="25fc-227e-ddb0-189" name="Magister on Disc of Tzeentch" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">14&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">7</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">2</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="4d85-25d8-a8b-e602" name="Fates Converge" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">While you have 6 or more **fate points**, add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of melee weapons used by friendly **^^Arcanite^^** units while they are wholly within 12&quot; of this unit.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ecf1-d6ea-5105-440e" name="Spellmaster" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Reaction: You declared a **^^Spell^^** ability for a **^^Wizard^^** within 30&quot; of this unit and the casting roll equalled or exceeded the spell's casting value and that spell has not been unbound</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Make an unbinding roll of 2D6. If the roll exceeds the casting value, the spell is unbound and its effect is not resolved.
If the spell is unbound, add 1 to casting rolls for this unit for the rest of the phase.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f">**^^Unbind^^**</characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="3bc-444a-5cf8-e4d" name="Guarded Hero" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If this **^^Hero^^** is within the combat range of a friendly unit that is not a **^^Hero^^**:
• Subtract 1 from hit rolls for shooting attacks that target this Hero.
• If this **^^Hero^^** is **^^Infantry^^**, they cannot be picked as the target of shooting attacks made by models more than 12&quot; from them.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="8e01-c601-8a44-8f74" name="Fly" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">As this unit moves, it ignores other models, terrain features and the combat ranges of enemy units. It cannot end its move in combat unless specified in the ability that allowed it to move. Ignore any vertical distance moved for this unit.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Gray</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Movement</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="u0rbft" name="Magister on Disc of Tzeentch" entryId="1a2d-6f5c-e17e-d2f6::3a33-6b20-1fb6-358c" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="u6vsp4j" name="Disc's Teeth and Horns" entryId="1a2d-6f5c-e17e-d2f6::52ac-845b-84e4-7db8" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="46ad-6e5c-3147-20ff" name="Disc's Teeth and Horns" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">D3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Companion</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="u60xpx" name="Tzeentchian Runestaff" entryId="1a2d-6f5c-e17e-d2f6::7583-f728-d63f-5cc3" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="4b04-6843-a3a6-d5d5" name="Tzeentchian Runestaff" hidden="false" typeId="1fd-a42f-41d3-fe05" typeName="Ranged Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Rng" typeId="c6b5-908c-a604-1a98">18&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="aa17-4296-2887-e05d">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="194d-aeb6-5ba7-83b4">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="d3d5-9dc6-13de-8d1">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="d03f-a9ae-3eec-755">-</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="96c2-d0a5-ea1e-653b">D3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="d793-3dd7-9c13-741e">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="u607yaj" name="Warpsteel Sword" entryId="1a2d-6f5c-e17e-d2f6::fd8d-d78e-fef-62c5" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="fd17-3993-1e41-cc68" name="Warpsteel Sword" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">-</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="150" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" name="CHAOS" entryId="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" primary="false" /><category id="d64d-ec64-3cf-cc4" name="DISCIPLES OF TZEENTCH" entryId="d64d-ec64-3cf-cc4" primary="false" /><category id="926c-df8c-6841-d49e" name="CAVALRY" entryId="926c-df8c-6841-d49e" primary="false" /><category id="6960-3f0d-5b0-2ec4" name="DISC OF TZEENTCH" entryId="6960-3f0d-5b0-2ec4" primary="false" /><category id="b979-4c3e-7d0e-6921" name="FLY" entryId="b979-4c3e-7d0e-6921" primary="false" /><category id="6f28-c3f6-4b1b-8aff" name="WIZARD (1)" entryId="6f28-c3f6-4b1b-8aff" primary="false" /><category id="4fa7-56fe-431f-fd98" name="ARCANITE" entryId="4fa7-56fe-431f-fd98" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="uj97gc9" name="Ogroid Thaumaturge" entryId="2301-a04e-88f0-9c7c::a004-88b6-b2eb-5879" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="decd-6c20-4ed2-e15c" name="Ogroid Thaumaturge" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">6&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">8</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">5+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">2</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="67ad-473b-124f-bbaf" name="Arcane Absorption" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">End of Any Turn</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">If any damage points were allocated to an enemy **^^Wizard^^** or **^^Priest^^** by this unit's attacks this turn and that enemy unit has been destroyed:
• **Heal (7)** this unit.
• Add 1 to this unit's power level for the rest of the battle.
This unit can be affected by this ability multiple times and the effects are cumulative.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Purple</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="265b-b879-3cf-7839" name="Thaumaturgic Hunger" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Reaction: Opponent declared a **^^Spell^^** ability for a unit within 30&quot; of this unit.</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">This unit can move 6&quot;. It can move into combat and must end that move closer to the caster. If this unit was in combat at the start of the move, it must end that move in combat.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f">**^^Move^^**</characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Movement</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="3bc-444a-5cf8-e4d" name="Guarded Hero" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If this **^^Hero^^** is within the combat range of a friendly unit that is not a **^^Hero^^**:
• Subtract 1 from hit rolls for shooting attacks that target this Hero.
• If this **^^Hero^^** is **^^Infantry^^**, they cannot be picked as the target of shooting attacks made by models more than 12&quot; from them.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="ujnnpw" name="Ogroid Thaumaturge" entryId="2301-a04e-88f0-9c7c::a0e9-66e0-ce07-41a3" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="uoa50fp" name="Great Horns and Cloven Hooves" entryId="2301-a04e-88f0-9c7c::b496-9b3e-1338-553f" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="ad29-b928-84ce-732b" name="Great Horns and Cloven Hooves" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">6</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">2+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Charge (+1 Damage)</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="uoy07u" name="Thaumaturge Staff" entryId="2301-a04e-88f0-9c7c::fb83-c585-224f-b65d" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="91bd-cc85-315f-98c" name="Thaumaturge Staff" hidden="false" typeId="1fd-a42f-41d3-fe05" typeName="Ranged Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Rng" typeId="c6b5-908c-a604-1a98">12&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="aa17-4296-2887-e05d">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="194d-aeb6-5ba7-83b4">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="d3d5-9dc6-13de-8d1">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="d03f-a9ae-3eec-755">-</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="96c2-d0a5-ea1e-653b">D3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="d793-3dd7-9c13-741e">Shoot in Combat</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="110" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" name="CHAOS" entryId="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" primary="false" /><category id="d64d-ec64-3cf-cc4" name="DISCIPLES OF TZEENTCH" entryId="d64d-ec64-3cf-cc4" primary="false" /><category id="6f28-c3f6-4b1b-8aff" name="WIZARD (1)" entryId="6f28-c3f6-4b1b-8aff" primary="false" /><category id="4fa7-56fe-431f-fd98" name="ARCANITE" entryId="4fa7-56fe-431f-fd98" primary="false" /><category id="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" name="INFANTRY" entryId="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" primary="false" /><category id="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" name="WARD (6+)" entryId="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="uy3xwp" name="Ogroid Thaumaturge (Scourge of Aqshy)" entryId="9cc0-e54f-b7e7-a6e6::030d-aff9-d98e-9bf2" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="cefd-228b-ae3d-a35e" name="Ogroid Thaumaturge" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">6&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">8</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">5+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">2</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="cc34-50a3-2104-3991" name="Soul-Deep Devotion" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">While this unit is within a friendly non-**^^Hero^^** **^^Arcanite^^** unit's combat range:
• This unit has **Ward (4+)**.
• Each time you make a successful ward roll for this unit, allocate 1 damage point to a friendly non-**^^Hero^^** **^^Arcanite^^** unit within this unit's combat range after the damage sequence for this unit has been resolved (ward rolls cannot be made for those damage points).</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Green</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="769c-6c6c-9529-6a43" name="Wrath of the Thaumaturge" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Any Charge Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">If this unit is not in combat, pick a friendly **^^Arcanite^^** unit in combat to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Remove this unit from the battlefield and set it up again within 1&quot; of the target and in combat. This unit has charged.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f">**^^Core^^**, **^^Charge^^**</characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Orange</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Movement</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="3bc-444a-5cf8-e4d" name="Guarded Hero" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If this **^^Hero^^** is within the combat range of a friendly unit that is not a **^^Hero^^**:
• Subtract 1 from hit rolls for shooting attacks that target this Hero.
• If this **^^Hero^^** is **^^Infantry^^**, they cannot be picked as the target of shooting attacks made by models more than 12&quot; from them.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="uyxiix" name="Ogroid Thaumaturge" entryId="9cc0-e54f-b7e7-a6e6::8e22-a8ce-747e-c217" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="v34x7y" name="Great Horns and Cloven Hooves" entryId="9cc0-e54f-b7e7-a6e6::7d27-8eab-bbb7-ba92" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="0ce3-26d1-fe06-8e16" name="Great Horns and Cloven Hooves" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">6</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">2+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Charge (+1 Damage)</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="v2kj5fu" name="Thaumaturge Staff" entryId="9cc0-e54f-b7e7-a6e6::5923-3ef9-62a7-fe7e" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="32c8-5302-8ebb-76f8" name="Thaumaturge Staff" hidden="false" typeId="1fd-a42f-41d3-fe05" typeName="Ranged Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Rng" typeId="c6b5-908c-a604-1a98">12&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="aa17-4296-2887-e05d">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="194d-aeb6-5ba7-83b4">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="d3d5-9dc6-13de-8d1">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="d03f-a9ae-3eec-755">-</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="96c2-d0a5-ea1e-653b">D3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="d793-3dd7-9c13-741e">Shoot in Combat</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="210" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" name="CHAOS" entryId="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" primary="false" /><category id="d64d-ec64-3cf-cc4" name="DISCIPLES OF TZEENTCH" entryId="d64d-ec64-3cf-cc4" primary="false" /><category id="6f28-c3f6-4b1b-8aff" name="WIZARD (1)" entryId="6f28-c3f6-4b1b-8aff" primary="false" /><category id="4fa7-56fe-431f-fd98" name="ARCANITE" entryId="4fa7-56fe-431f-fd98" primary="false" /><category id="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" name="INFANTRY" entryId="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" primary="false" /><category id="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" name="WARD (6+)" entryId="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="vju9tt3" name="The Blue Scribes" entryId="3509-803d-12be-64ad::c98c-bc30-6030-0422" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="28c8-99ae-9bbc-0090" name="The Blue Scribes" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">14&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">2</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="447e-48cc-0bee-0e9c" name="Treacherous Bond" hidden="false" typeId="7312-8367-c171-f2ef" typeName="Ability (Spell)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="de6f-d57b-248a-83be">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Casting Value" typeId="9fc7-b0f6-d018-a608">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">Pick a friendly unit within this unit's combat range to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">Until the start of your next turn:
• This unit has **^^Ward (4+)^^**.
• Each time you make an unmodified ward roll of 1-3 for this unit, allocate 1 damage point to the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="353f-565e-c351-1cf2">**^^Spell^^**</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="16b6-0911-f549-a4bd">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="da27-8d61-f955-5031">Defensive</attribute></attributes></profile><profile id="00b1-47b7-8351-0407" name="Scrolls of Sorcery" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">The next time this unit uses a non-**^^Summon Spell^^** ability this phase, do not make a casting roll as part of that ability. Instead, roll a dice. On a 2+, the spell is successfully cast and cannot be unbound.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="3bc-444a-5cf8-e4d" name="Guarded Hero" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If this **^^Hero^^** is within the combat range of a friendly unit that is not a **^^Hero^^**:
• Subtract 1 from hit rolls for shooting attacks that target this Hero.
• If this **^^Hero^^** is **^^Infantry^^**, they cannot be picked as the target of shooting attacks made by models more than 12&quot; from them.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="8e01-c601-8a44-8f74" name="Fly" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">As this unit moves, it ignores other models, terrain features and the combat ranges of enemy units. It cannot end its move in combat unless specified in the ability that allowed it to move. Ignore any vertical distance moved for this unit.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Gray</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Movement</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="vkas68m" name="The Blue Scribes" entryId="3509-803d-12be-64ad::59e3-1822-a8ee-fea9" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="vnx7uh" name="Disc's Teeth and Horns" entryId="3509-803d-12be-64ad::7a44-b494-b5f1-e382" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="020b-1db4-0dc8-e8c7" name="Disc's Teeth and Horns" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">D3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Companion</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="vmbgzlm" name="Sharpened Quills" entryId="3509-803d-12be-64ad::909e-8d15-e664-3115" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="0da1-9724-8fad-ceb3" name="Sharpened Quills" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">5+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">5+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">-</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159"></characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="180" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="72ce-2188-70bf-2dbd" name="UNIQUE" entryId="72ce-2188-70bf-2dbd" primary="false" /><category id="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" name="CHAOS" entryId="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" primary="false" /><category id="acaf-8bb6-d6f-3e2a" name="Legends" entryId="acaf-8bb6-d6f-3e2a" primary="false" /><category id="926c-df8c-6841-d49e" name="CAVALRY" entryId="926c-df8c-6841-d49e" primary="false" /><category id="b979-4c3e-7d0e-6921" name="FLY" entryId="b979-4c3e-7d0e-6921" primary="false" /><category id="d64d-ec64-3cf-cc4" name="DISCIPLES OF TZEENTCH" entryId="d64d-ec64-3cf-cc4" primary="false" /><category id="dc0b-e417-51f4-10f0" name="DAEMON" entryId="dc0b-e417-51f4-10f0" primary="false" /><category id="6f28-c3f6-4b1b-8aff" name="WIZARD (1)" entryId="6f28-c3f6-4b1b-8aff" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="ltibm2t" name="The Changeling" entryId="ac6e-a933-6887-ebb1::be93-ef60-f866-2f4d" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="96ff-1a01-34fc-7386" name="The Changeling" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">5&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">6</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">5+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">2</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="1c6b-97d0-ebea-f49c" name="Arch-Deceiver" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">This unit can only use this ability if it is **masked by illusion**. Pick a model in a friendly **^^Disciples of Tzeentch^^** unit to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">This unit can immediately use a **^^Spell^^** ability. When it does so, measure the range and visibility of that **^^Spell^^** ability from the target. The target is treated as the caster for the purposes of other abilities such as 'Unbind'.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="2d39-8af0-b6f3-567e" name="Puckish Misdirection" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">While they are wholly within 12&quot; of this unit, friendly **^^Disciples of Tzeentch^^** units can use the 'Redeploy' command even if they were set up in the same turn.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Grey</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Movement</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="1b63-b0b4-f62b-d5be" name="Whispers of Treachery" hidden="false" typeId="7312-8367-c171-f2ef" typeName="Ability (Spell)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="de6f-d57b-248a-83be">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Casting Value" typeId="9fc7-b0f6-d018-a608">7</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">Pick a visible enemy unit within 18&quot; of this unit to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">Roll a dice for each model in the target unit. For each 5+, inflict 1 mortal damage on the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="353f-565e-c351-1cf2">**^^Spell^^**</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="16b6-0911-f549-a4bd">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="da27-8d61-f955-5031" /></attributes></profile><profile id="3bc-444a-5cf8-e4d" name="Guarded Hero" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If this **^^Hero^^** is within the combat range of a friendly unit that is not a **^^Hero^^**:
• Subtract 1 from hit rolls for shooting attacks that target this Hero.
• If this **^^Hero^^** is **^^Infantry^^**, they cannot be picked as the target of shooting attacks made by models more than 12&quot; from them.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="lu6bd9i" name="The Changeling" entryId="ac6e-a933-6887-ebb1::7929-418e-1cb8-343b" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="lv4ds5j" name="The Trickster's Staff" entryId="ac6e-a933-6887-ebb1::2213-931d-582f-4c6c" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="9060-f6b8-3e38-8882" name="The Trickster's Staff" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">D3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="140" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" name="CHAOS" entryId="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" primary="false" /><category id="dc0b-e417-51f4-10f0" name="DAEMON" entryId="dc0b-e417-51f4-10f0" primary="false" /><category id="d64d-ec64-3cf-cc4" name="DISCIPLES OF TZEENTCH" entryId="d64d-ec64-3cf-cc4" primary="false" /><category id="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" name="INFANTRY" entryId="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" primary="false" /><category id="72ce-2188-70bf-2dbd" name="UNIQUE" entryId="72ce-2188-70bf-2dbd" primary="false" /><category id="8179-697a-9f4c-91d4" name="WIZARD (2)" entryId="8179-697a-9f4c-91d4" primary="false" /><category id="52cc-95fd-6cd3-8f72" name="WARD (5+)" entryId="52cc-95fd-6cd3-8f72" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="m5x45d" name="Tzaangor Shaman" entryId="db9-e515-58e6-8374::ccc4-afaa-f9b3-8b3e" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="a382-f42f-4b0c-cc36" name="Tzaangor Shaman" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">14&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">6</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">5+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">2</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="2dad-e15d-3623-46d4" name="Avian Swiftness" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a visible friendly **^^Arcanite^^** unit wholly within 12&quot; of this unit to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a dice. On a 3+, for the rest of the turn, the target can use **^^Charge^^** abilities even if it used a **^^Run^^** ability in the same turn.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Movement</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="6d13-419c-32d2-feb2" name="Wit of Beasts" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Any Combat Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a visible enemy **^^Monster^^** or **^^Cavalry^^** unit within 6&quot; of the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">The target's melee weapons have the **Companion** ability for the rest of the turn.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="3bc-444a-5cf8-e4d" name="Guarded Hero" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If this **^^Hero^^** is within the combat range of a friendly unit that is not a **^^Hero^^**:
• Subtract 1 from hit rolls for shooting attacks that target this Hero.
• If this **^^Hero^^** is **^^Infantry^^**, they cannot be picked as the target of shooting attacks made by models more than 12&quot; from them.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="8e01-c601-8a44-8f74" name="Fly" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">As this unit moves, it ignores other models, terrain features and the combat ranges of enemy units. It cannot end its move in combat unless specified in the ability that allowed it to move. Ignore any vertical distance moved for this unit.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Gray</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Movement</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="m6ysj1l" name="Tzaangor Shaman" entryId="db9-e515-58e6-8374::db2-d6a-1e63-f8b4" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="mb0gmpf" name="Disc's Teeth and Horns" entryId="db9-e515-58e6-8374::f6b0-1af3-1e33-a34e" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="b156-30ec-4f1c-8df4" name="Disc's Teeth and Horns" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">D3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Companion</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="mbw8y9s" name="Staff of Change and Ritual Dagger" entryId="db9-e515-58e6-8374::81c3-583a-a6d2-eb68" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="f78e-13a8-c55f-e71d" name="Staff of Change and Ritual Dagger" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">D3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="130" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" name="CHAOS" entryId="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" primary="false" /><category id="d64d-ec64-3cf-cc4" name="DISCIPLES OF TZEENTCH" entryId="d64d-ec64-3cf-cc4" primary="false" /><category id="926c-df8c-6841-d49e" name="CAVALRY" entryId="926c-df8c-6841-d49e" primary="false" /><category id="b979-4c3e-7d0e-6921" name="FLY" entryId="b979-4c3e-7d0e-6921" primary="false" /><category id="6f28-c3f6-4b1b-8aff" name="WIZARD (1)" entryId="6f28-c3f6-4b1b-8aff" primary="false" /><category id="4fa7-56fe-431f-fd98" name="ARCANITE" entryId="4fa7-56fe-431f-fd98" primary="false" /><category id="33cc-ab90-fc8f-69ec" name="WARFLOCK" entryId="33cc-ab90-fc8f-69ec" primary="false" /><category id="6960-3f0d-5b0-2ec4" name="DISC OF TZEENTCH" entryId="6960-3f0d-5b0-2ec4" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="moefc3c" name="Blue Horrors and Brimstone Horrors" entryId="a021-3050-9e63-2cba::6cb0-cc58-9cee-f204" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="6f93-1cd0-caf8-14bd" name="Blue Horrors and Brimstone Horrors" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">6&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">6+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">1</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="4f6d-2336-aa0a-8434" name="Split Again" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">End of Any Turn</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a dice for each **Blue Horror** model in this unit that is slain. For each 3+, if there are fewer **Brimstone Horrors** models in this unit than its starting size, you can add 1 **Brimstone Horrors** model to this unit.
**Designer's Note:** *Dice are only rolled for Blue Horror models that are currently slain – models that have been slain and returned to this unit do not count until they are slain once more. When adding Brimstone Horrors to this unit, do not count slain Brimstone Horrors towards the maximum.*</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Purple</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Rallying</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="c224-674c-4a9e-5cf0" name="Immolation" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">Slain **Brimstone Horrors** cannot be returned to this unit. When setting up a replacement unit for this unit, **Brimstone Horror** models are ignored when determining the number of models in this unit, and you cannot pick them to be set up.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="mqa1vrd" name="Blue Horror or Brimstone Horror" entryId="a021-3050-9e63-2cba::eeb6-957a-837-600a" number="10" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="mre6s" name="Arcane Flames" entryId="a021-3050-9e63-2cba::f3bd-5703-aa46-80ec" number="10" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="f314-64ca-6b8b-205f" name="Arcane Flames" hidden="false" typeId="1fd-a42f-41d3-fe05" typeName="Ranged Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Rng" typeId="c6b5-908c-a604-1a98">12&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="aa17-4296-2887-e05d">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="194d-aeb6-5ba7-83b4">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="d3d5-9dc6-13de-8d1">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="d03f-a9ae-3eec-755">-</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="96c2-d0a5-ea1e-653b">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="d793-3dd7-9c13-741e">Crit (Auto-wound)</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="mrihb0b" name="Spiteful Talons" entryId="a021-3050-9e63-2cba::e95d-1b14-ca1d-ac6f" number="10" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="f23-724f-d4f-aa91" name="Spiteful Talons" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">-</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="120" /></costs><categories><category id="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" entryId="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" name="INFANTRY" primary="true" /><category id="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" name="CHAOS" entryId="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" primary="false" /><category id="d64d-ec64-3cf-cc4" name="DISCIPLES OF TZEENTCH" entryId="d64d-ec64-3cf-cc4" primary="false" /><category id="dc0b-e417-51f4-10f0" name="DAEMON" entryId="dc0b-e417-51f4-10f0" primary="false" /><category id="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" name="WARD (6+)" entryId="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="n20d5ka" name="Ephilim's Pandaemonium" entryId="6cc6-84e2-8486-0351::16f4-4752-ac83-17ae" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="5bc4-b866-a2c2-2f8e" name="Ephilim's Pandaemonium" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">6&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">6+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">1</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="e145-3ad5-f780-3624" name="Power Leech" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn, Any Shooting Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a D3. Allocate a number of damage points to this unit equal to the roll (ward rolls cannot be made for those damage points). Then, add 2 to the Attacks characteristic of this unit's ranged weapons for the rest of the turn.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Blue</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Shooting</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="eacf-6ed8-4f05-6617" name="Keeper of the Pandaemonium" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">You can return D3 slain models to this unit.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Purple</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Rallying</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="n304x38" name="Apo'trax, the Starefysh" entryId="6cc6-84e2-8486-0351::687b-2e3c-a32e-65fb" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="n6yu4mm" name="Daemonic Talons" entryId="6cc6-84e2-8486-0351::4d1d-7ca3-10e9-b159" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="28ff-e8db-57b0-5b66" name="Daemonic Talons" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">5+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">-</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="n6oq05e" name="Warping Wyrdfire" entryId="6cc6-84e2-8486-0351::6611-96b5-b47f-aa4e" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="a9b3-f7c2-63c2-4c5b" name="Warping Wyrdfire" hidden="false" typeId="1fd-a42f-41d3-fe05" typeName="Ranged Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Rng" typeId="c6b5-908c-a604-1a98">12&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="aa17-4296-2887-e05d">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="194d-aeb6-5ba7-83b4">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="d3d5-9dc6-13de-8d1">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="d03f-a9ae-3eec-755">-</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="96c2-d0a5-ea1e-653b">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="d793-3dd7-9c13-741e">Anti-**^^Unique^^** (+1 Rend)</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection><selection id="n3uvpaa" name="Ephilim the Unknowable" entryId="6cc6-84e2-8486-0351::c329-fce6-8be7-29b6" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="n60yn5a" name="Daemonic Talons" entryId="6cc6-84e2-8486-0351::5f5b-53e6-666b-4dca" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="542a-9239-3d0c-56e1" name="Daemonic Talons" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">5+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">-</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="n7fxbwd" name="Warping Wyrdfire" entryId="6cc6-84e2-8486-0351::f6e7-e6be-d9b0-ed2a" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="e757-cb09-d500-a28b" name="Warping Wyrdfire" hidden="false" typeId="1fd-a42f-41d3-fe05" typeName="Ranged Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Rng" typeId="c6b5-908c-a604-1a98">12&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="aa17-4296-2887-e05d">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="194d-aeb6-5ba7-83b4">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="d3d5-9dc6-13de-8d1">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="d03f-a9ae-3eec-755">-</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="96c2-d0a5-ea1e-653b">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="d793-3dd7-9c13-741e">Anti-**^^Unique^^** (+1 Rend)</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="n7cxos" name="Champion" entryId="6cc6-84e2-8486-0351::6cf8-d182-192a-7b50::9c21-1746-9873-a5b5" entryGroupId="6cc6-84e2-8486-0351::95b1-87da-7230-9898" number="1" type="upgrade" from="group" group="Command Models"><profiles><profile id="cfed-845b-b46c-fc6d" name="Champion" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">Add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of weapons used by champions in this unit. If this unit is a **^^Beast^^**, this ability affects this unit's **Companion** weapons.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><categories><category id="9c77-5e0b-a20f-d885" name="Command Model" entryId="9c77-5e0b-a20f-d885" primary="false" /></categories></selection></selections></selection><selection id="n3zngmd" name="Flamespooler" entryId="6cc6-84e2-8486-0351::a2e2-e3a2-1e09-1e3c" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="n8fii" name="Daemonic Talons" entryId="6cc6-84e2-8486-0351::d7f6-f7da-9d27-ad51" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="d528-c8ee-3057-8637" name="Daemonic Talons" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">5+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">-</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="n8e3l9b" name="Warping Wyrdfire" entryId="6cc6-84e2-8486-0351::cb72-f9bf-ee23-d7e1" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="861e-489